🏠 Real Estate Price Prediction – Power BI Project
🔹 Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing real estate data to predict property prices, market trends, and investment opportunities.
Using Python, SQL, and Power BI, the system analyzes:


Property features (area, BHK, location)


Market trends


Pricing patterns


Buyer demand


👉 Predictive models are used to estimate future property prices and identify high-value investment areas
👉 Final output: Interactive Power BI dashboard for real-time decision-making

